# Narrow exception. This file holds NEXT_PUBLIC_ values only, which are compiled
# into the pages and readable by anyone who views source, so there is nothing in
# it to leak. It is committed because a release built without it silently stops
# counting visits and nothing on screen says so. Never put a secret in it: a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ name is a promise that the value is public.
!apps/web/.env.production
